{"log":"review of Lab · Templates (387:2), read-only, 2 Figma calls: screenshot 387:3 at 2000, close-up 390:148. Verdict: fix first (minor)."}
{"log":"1. [fix] 387:3 Root is 7636 x 6032 = 1.27:1, not about 2:1 as asked; the doc says 6249 / 1.2:1, so the doc and the file disagree. Fix: put the 500 and 1000 groups side by side on one row with 1920 beside or below, or re-flow so width/height is near 2; correct the number in templates-2026-11-18.md."}
{"log":"2. [fix] Voids (the ask said none): under every Short page (500 `391:117`, 1000 `391:225`, 1920 `391:349`) next to its Long page, a blank column up to 1000 high at 1920; the Test group 394:412 is about 1000 shorter than its row (doc admits it); 500 group Sections column ends before its group. Fix: stack Short above Long, or add the Short page to the Test group, and let each group Hug its tallest column."}
{"log":"3. [fix] 1000 / 1920 `Card · Header + Footer` (388:41, 390:154): a large gap between body text and the Footer buttons (two `pad`s, 96 at 1000). Reads as a void inside the card. Fix: Footer top padding 0 bound to a token (or `text-gap`), or put Buttons into the Body; the doc flags it but ships it."}
{"log":"4. [note] 1920 Long page (391:382) 'Text beside a photo': the photo is small and pushed to the right edge of the 1600 container, text far left, a wide empty middle. Fix: use equal 2 columns (text left, photo fills right column)."}
{"log":"5. [note] Lint warnings: 16 padded-no-fill on transparent Header/Body sections are shipped, not resolved; rule 2 wording is not updated in the readme Rules. Fix: update rule 2 per vocabulary-v6 caveat 3 and make lint skip section-in-frame, or say so in the readme Rules."}
{"log":"6. [note] 'A swapped Content keeps its old height' is documented, but the pages ship with this trap unfixed (stale tall Bodies are visible in the 1000 Cards column, e.g. 'Text at 904' / 'Text at 436' blocks have extra bottom space). Fix: set Content to Hug in the masters so a swap needs no extra step."}
{"log":"7. [note] Step count: 22 steps is 5 + 17 typing; the Explorations comparison (34) counts differently (Index vs templates). Fix: state both with the same rule (typing counted in both) or drop the comparison."}
{"log":"Not verified: no layout.json, so Scale-mode-on-masters, token binding and the 1920 Container cap were judged by eye (the 1920 Card master 390:148 is 1624 wide, correct with the 1600 Content); the other 1000/1920 Content eyebrows could not be read at this scale."}
{"log":"Verdict: fix first. The model works and the templates look consistent at all three sizes; the miss is the 2:1 ratio and the voids the owner asked to avoid, both quick layout fixes."}
